================================================================================
TEST SUITE IMPLEMENTATION PLAN
================================================================================

CURRENT GOAL
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Verify functionality of the Kanban backend by adding tests to uncover what
works and what doesn't.

SCOPE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Test three components:
  1. API Endpoints (active routes only)
  2. JSON-based storage (JsonStorage)
  3. Database-based storage (SqlAlchemyStorage)

PLAN
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. Run existing tests to establish baseline
   - Dependencies must be installed first (pip install -e ".[dev]")

2. Refactor conftest.py
   - Add parameterized storage fixture for ["json", "sqlite"]
   - SQLite uses in-memory database (sqlite:///:memory:)
   - JSON uses temp file

3. Refactor test_storage.py
   - Use parameterized storage fixture
   - Run identical CRUD tests against both backends sequentially
   - Cover: boards, columns, tasks (get/create/update/delete + not-found)

4. Add/expand API tests
   - Test active endpoints only using SQLite-backed client:
     * GET  /api/boards              - List all boards
     * GET  /api/boards/{id}         - Get board by ID
     * GET  /api/columns/{id}/tasks  - Get tasks by column
     * POST /api/tasks               - Create task
     * PUT  /api/tasks/{task_id}     - Update task
   - Verify 404 handling and success responses

5. Analyze results to identify what works and what doesn't

TEST FILE STRUCTURE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
tests/
  conftest.py              - Parametrized storage fixture
  test_storage.py           - Shared tests via parametrize
  test_api_boards.py        - Board endpoint tests
  test_api_tasks.py         - Task endpoint tests
  test_api_columns.py       - Column endpoint tests (GET /api/columns/{id}/tasks)

DECISIONS RESOLVED
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[x] Active endpoints only (leave commented-out routes as-is)
[x] Fresh test database per run
[x] Sequential (parametrized) testing - shared test logic via @pytest.mark.parametrize
[x] In-memory SQLite for SqlAlchemyStorage tests
[x] No KanbanService tests (implementation may change)
[x] SQLite as default storage for API tests

BLOCKERS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- Dependencies not installed: pip install -e ".[dev]" must be run before tests
